# Copy to .dev.vars for `bun run dev`. Never commit .dev.vars.
# (Not named .dev.vars.example: the Deploy to Cloudflare button would ask for these as secrets.)
#
# Local only: /app/sign-in shows the magic link on the page (and logs it) instead of emailing it.
# Honored only for localhost requests. Sign in as dev@localhost to see what `bun run seed` creates.
DEV_SIGNIN=1
#
# Anyone may sign up locally; deployments use invite (cloudflare.config.ts).
SIGNUP=open
#
# The managed agent, @tempra (TEMPRA-222): "fake" runs it on a scripted stand-in with no network
# (honored only with DEV_SIGNIN=1). For the real model, set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY here instead. Either
# way it answers only for accounts with a budget: `bun run admin limits --email dev@localhost
# --set agent_daily_usd=5`.
AGENT_MODEL=fake
